<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Clear Skies</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 33), Druid (guild level 43)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast clear skies</a>
</pre>
<p>You call on the forces of nature for fair weather. A warm breeze touches 
everyone, and the weather of the whole area turns towards the better: the 
storm calms, the rain stops, the clouds part. The stronger your spell, the 
faster it turns.
</p><p>It only works under the open sky: indoors, or anywhere without weather, 
nothing happens. Sun ray needs a cloudless sky. Storm call does the opposite. 
It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Weather</a>
